### Health — order
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

### Health — payment
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health

### Health — restaurant
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/health

### Restaurant — oluştur
# @name createRestaurant
POST http://localhost:8083/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Adana Sofrası",
  "address": "Caferağa Mah. Kadıköy / İstanbul",
  "cuisine": "Türk",
  "open": true
}

### Restaurant — liste
GET http://localhost:8083/api/restaurants

### Restaurant — tek kayıt
GET http://localhost:8083/api/restaurants/{{createRestaurant.response.body.id}}

### Restaurant — güncelle (kapat)
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/restaurants/{{createRestaurant.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Adana Sofrası",
  "address": "Caferağa Mah. Kadıköy / İstanbul",
  "cuisine": "Türk",
  "open": false
}

### Restaurant — sil
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/restaurants/{{createRestaurant.response.body.id}}

### Order — oluştur
# @name createOrder
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "restaurantId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "totalAmount": 149.90
}

### Order — liste
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders

### Order — tek kayıt
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}

### Order — güncelle (CONFIRMED)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "restaurantId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "totalAmount": 149.90,
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### Order — sil
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}

### Payment — oluştur
# @name createPayment
POST http://localhost:8082/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{createOrder.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": 149.90
}

### Payment — liste
GET http://localhost:8082/api/payments

### Payment — tek kayıt
GET http://localhost:8082/api/payments/{{createPayment.response.body.id}}

### Payment — güncelle (CAPTURED)
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/payments/{{createPayment.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{createOrder.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": 149.90,
  "status": "CAPTURED"
}

### Payment — sil
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/payments/{{createPayment.response.body.id}}

### Hata — 404
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Hata — 400 (negatif tutar)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "restaurantId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "totalAmount": -1
}
